From 54772fd59ee43887da40d1302db5215bbe32c119 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DiabloNova <diablonova@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:12:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 17/19] fix(R2): resolve cubic review findings in counter
 contract and telemetry

- Tri-state anchor_provider_generation_evidence (CONFIRMED/UNKNOWN/UNAVAILABLE
  with mandatory reason codes); count advances only on CONFIRMED
- Confirmed-response branch now names every counter update incl. per-generation
  billing UNAVAILABLE(BILLING_FEED_MISSING) instead of zero
- Timeout/error branch sets UNKNOWN reason codes; never advances generation count
- Explicit mid-render halt/fallback branch: terminal_regime = FAST_PATH only on
  clean EOS; every other exit reports FALLBACK with full_oracle_fallback_count
- Mandatory ingestion dedup rule by stable event_id with conflict handling;
  counters advanced only by the runtime state machine
- telemetry-schema.json v2 + request/event CSV templates aligned with contract
- next-steps.md names both instrumentation boundaries (runtime-event vs transport)
